   1:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c **** /**
   2:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  ******************************************************************************
   3:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * @file    kalman filter.c
   4:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * @author  Wang Hongxi
   5:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * @version V1.2.2
   6:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * @date    2022/1/8
   7:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * @brief   C implementation of kalman filter
   8:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  ******************************************************************************
   9:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * @attention
  10:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * 该卡尔曼滤波器可以在传感器采样频率不同的情况下，动态调整矩阵H R和
  11:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * This implementation of kalman filter can dynamically adjust dimension and
  12:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * value of matrix H R and K according to the measurement validity under any
  13:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * circumstance that the sampling rate of component sensors are different.
  14:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  *
  15:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * 因此矩阵H和R的初始化会与矩阵P A和Q有所不同。另外的，在初始化量测向
  16:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * 入传感器量测所对应的状态与这个量测的方式，详情请见例程
  17:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * Therefore, the initialization of matrix P, F, and Q is sometimes different
  18:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * from that of matrices H R. when initialization. Additionally, the corresponding
  19:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * state and the method of the measurement should be provided when initializing
  20:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * measurement vector z. For more details, please see the example.
  21:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  *
  22:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * 若不需要动态调整量测向量z，可简单将结构体中的Use_Auto_Adjustment初始化�
  23:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * 始化矩阵P那样用常规方式初始化z H R即可。
  24:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * If automatic adjustment is not required, assign zero to the UseAutoAdjustment
  25:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * and initialize z H R in the normal way as matrix P.
  26:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  *
  27:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * 要求量测向量z与控制向量u在传感器回调函数中更新。整数0意味着量测无
  28:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * 滤波更新后无传感器数据更新。因此量测向量z与控制向量u会在卡尔曼滤�
  29:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * MeasuredVector and ControlVector are required to be updated in the sensor
  30:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * callback function. Integer 0 in measurement vector z indicates the invalidity
  31:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * of current measurement, so MeasuredVector and ControlVector will be reset
ARM GAS  D:\temp\TMP\ccu2GakD.s 			page 2


  32:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * (to 0) during each update.
  33:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  *
  34:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * 此外，矩阵P过度收敛后滤波器将难以再适应状态的缓慢变化，从而产生�
  35:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * 通过限制矩阵P最小值的方法，可有效抑制滤波器的过度收敛，详情请见�
  36:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * Additionally, the excessive convergence of matrix P will make filter incapable
  37:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * of adopting the slowly changing state. This implementation can effectively
  38:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * suppress filter excessive convergence through boundary limiting for matrix P.
  39:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * For more details, please see the example.
  40:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  *
  41:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * @example:
  42:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  * x =
  43:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  *   |   height   |
  44:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  *   |  velocity  |
  45:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  *   |acceleration|
  46:Robot/Algorithm/kalman/kalman_filter.c ****  *
